# Keep stale runtime + build artifacts out of the Docker build context so the
# image compiles FRESH (per arenadata/readme.md: "Make sure that directory
# doesn't contain binary objects from previous builds"). All source — including
# src/test/regress/expected/*.out baselines and generated parser files — is kept.

# Demo-cluster data dirs — regenerated by make_cluster, ~GBs, must not be baked in
gpAux/gpdemo/datadirs/

# Core dumps
core
core.*
*.core
**/core.[0-9]*

# Compiled build products from previous (incremental) builds — force a clean compile
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.so.[0-9]*
**/*.bc
